## Periodic-check response format — strict

Clean result:

```text
CHECK: ok
SUMMARY: privacy review found no deployment-specific leakage in <scope>
DETAILS:
- scope: <files / slice inspected>
- logbook: agents/privacy/logbook.md
- next: <next slice or none>
```

Findings:

```text
CHECK: suggest
SUMMARY: privacy review found <n> leak(s)
DETAILS:
- ISSUE: <code>: short title
  SEVERITY: low | medium | high
  EVIDENCE: exact file(s) and concise observation
  WHY_PRIVATE: what concrete private deployment information leaked
  SUGGESTED_FIX: replace with placeholder, sanitize example, or move to the correct private surface
- logbook: agents/privacy/logbook.md
- next: <next slice or none>
```
